s copy API. Read-API behavior stays unchanged apart from the engine version reported by `/healthz`.\n\n## Why\n\nHosts need the read API and dispatching engine to share an engine release so the browser can parse the records being written. This upgrade lets hosts adopt the store’s retry-safe creates and guarded writes while keeping their reader aligned.\n\n## Additional info\n\nThe breaking-change designation announces the linked-engine move because this crate’s public API exposes engine types. The lockfile also moves uuid to 1.29.0, as required by the updated store.","created_at":"2026-11-01T00:23:17Z","updated_at":"2026-11-01T00:51:53Z","closed_at":"2026-11-01T00:51:51Z","merged_at":"2026-11-01T00:51:51Z","merge_commit_sha":"97395409044c97a44997ec8d7150304849e13be7","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/563/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/563/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/563/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/2ac3db17c80ad85d3f01a35e23ead2b8479b5c93","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/554/ui-link-follow-up-sync","ref":"nick/554/ui-link-follow-up-sync","sha":"2ac3db17c80ad85d3f01a35e23ead2b8479b5c93","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https:/