tis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nMake the browser read API build directly through Cargo, removing its dependency on `just` so visual-docs captures can run in the screenshot container. Preserve the isolated binary path used by screenshots and browser tests, along with shared build intermediates.\n\n## Why\n\nUsers rely on visual-docs screenshots to review changes to the Action items view before accepting them. The runtime upgrade left captures failing before rendering a page because the container has no `just`, blocking visual review of subsequent changes.","created_at":"2026-10-31T08:48:31Z","updated_at":"2026-10-31T09:11:18Z","closed_at":"2026-10-31T09:11:16Z","merged_at":"2026-10-31T09:11:16Z","merge_commit_sha":"cb9c4859fef036a5a836dd8995cfdd0d277c6466","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/561/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/561/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/561/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/c885daabba29795928155db9357589909af6fab0","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/Human-action-items-across-manager-sessions/visual-capture-build-fix","ref":"nick/Human-action-items-across-manager-sessions/visual-capture-build-fix","sha":"c885daabba29795928155db9357589909af6fab0","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_ur