ne 0.97.0’s live runtime, so the Action items page and CLI share durable state, owning-session notifications, scheduling holds and design-review approvals. Replace sample-adapter journeys with real runtime browser, CLI and API coverage, and isolate the browser test server’s build output and stop fixture writers before teardown.\n\n## Why\n\nA single visible queue lets the operator focus on the most urgent human work while unrelated development continues.\n\n## Additional info\n\nBreaking change: the public API exposes engine types, whose identity changes with this pre-1.0 minor upgrade. The linked engine and pinned test CLI use the same release. Human-item wire schemas remain unchanged.\n\nThe `--human-items-sample` flag and sample-serving API are removed. Hosts must enable human items in the engine’s configuration; disabled hosts receive `503 human_items_unavailable`.","created_at":"2026-10-31T06:36:37Z","updated_at":"2026-10-31T08:18:20Z","closed_at":"2026-10-31T08:18:18Z","merged_at":"2026-10-31T08:18:18Z","merge_commit_sha":"2ab8b499e4dfb8f4446cd0aa700c90dcb7f0e863","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/558/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/558/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/558/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/72415a26771231bccf89cbdce3bb4312cf5689ae","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/537/ui-runtime-adoption","ref":"nick/537/ui-runtime-adoption","sha":"72415a26771231bccf89cbdce3bb4312cf5689ae","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":1327351155,"node_id":"R_kgDOTx3Fcw","name":"onepipeline-ui","full_name":"nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui","private":false,"owner":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public