:{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":0,"open_issues":73,"watchers":1,"default_branch":"main"}},"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/552"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/552"},"issue":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/552"},"comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/552/comments"},"review_comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/552/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/552/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/b7961693061f85ba464b57e3025e0e9e3c678808"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":{"enabled_by":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"merge_method":"squash","commit_title":null,"commit_message":null},"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/547","id":5079938160,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx3Fc88AAAABLsm0cA","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/547","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/547.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/547.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/547","number":547,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat!: add a separate human action items view","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nAdd a separate Action items page and owner-scoped `/api/human-items` routes for tasks and questions. The dense, filterable queue supports inline keyboard answers, independent tracker links, completion and dismissal, with four-line body previews and full bodies and blocked steps in a detail pane. Refresh reloads the queue; the Host view stays unchanged. Browser types are generated from the engine’s published schemas.\n\n## Why\n\nA single visible queue lets the operator focus on the most urgent human work while unrelated development continues during human decisions.\n\n## Additional info\n\n- **Sample mode only:** routes use the published engine’s explicit sample adapter through test-only `--human-items-sample FILE`, refused over a nonempty runs root. Without it, they return `503 human_items_unavailable`. Production scheduling, persistence, bus delivery and lifecycle integration remain for runtime adoption.\n- HTTP actions record the server’s acting session as actor, with no `on_behalf_of`. Manager actions on a user’s behalf remain on the CLI/runtime path. Design reviews use ordinary Complete, preserving the engine’s stale-document refusal and replacement behavior. Pending requests keep items open, failed answers retain drafts, and repeated submission is blocked while a request is pending.\n- The branch uses published `onepipeline` 0.96.1 and its lock-derived sibling CLI pin. The linked-engine upgrade is already in the base branch; this diff adds its human-item surface. CLI list and report output remain unchanged, including full bodies.","created_at":"2026-10-30T05:29:29Z","updated_at":"2026-10-30T09:13:27Z","closed_at":"2026-10-30T09:13:24Z","merged_at":"2026-10-30T09:13:24Z","merge_commit_sha":"2f2f0560339ec4cedc5a037ccef5c61074598a63","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/547/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/547/comments","review_comme