repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/545","number":545,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(deps)!: link the engine whose onevcs never refuses a removal at the public boundary","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nRelink the read API from onepipeline 0.95.5 to 0.96.0, aligning dependencies with the engine’s lock, including onevcs 0.57.4 and onetaskgraph 0.12.11. The lock resolves one engine and one onevcs. Routes, response shapes and browser views are unchanged; `/healthz` reports the adopted engine version.\n\n## Why\n\nThe host can adopt the engine carrying the onevcs boundary fix only when the read API links that same release. This keeps the DAG view reading run records through the engine that writes them.\n\n## Additional info\n\nThis is a breaking dependency move: public Rust APIs, including `ApiError::from_engine`, expose the linked engine’s types.","created_at":"2026-10-30T04:20:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-30T05:55:32Z","closed_at":"2026-10-30T05:55:30Z","merged_at":"202