ts{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/105/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/f11f5110fe0d7229ace89db918abf5f53877624f"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/395","id":4936428878,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx3Fc88AAAABJjvtTg","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/395","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/395.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/395.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/395","number":395,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(deps): require the harness core and agent graph that the shared app-server engine links","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nRaise the minimum `oneharness-core` and `oneagentgraph` requirements to 0.28.5 and 0.5.14, aligning them with the engine already linked on main. Keep `onepipeline = \"=0.79.1\"` from [#388](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/388), which supersedes the earlier 0.79.0 target; this adds no further public API break.\n\n## Why\n\nHosts must keep their engine and browser-view pins aligned because browser-adopted runs are driven by this binary. Aligning these dependencies lets hosts adopt the engine that shares a Codex app-server across dispatches.\n\n## Additional info\n\nNo binary shipped here leases a pooled app-server: `onepipeline-api` drives single-sided turns through uncontrolled `codex exec`, while two-party turns run through the external `oneharness` executable, which hosts its own sweeper. The manifest documents why this repository needs no sweeper entry point.","created_at":"2026-10-20T13:25:41Z","updated_at":"2026-10-29T14:17:57Z","closed_at":"2026-10-29T14:17:57Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/395/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/395/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/395/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/a8dca64ea93de54002d1a0a2a289f16fda402a23","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/308/onepipeline-ui-link-shared-app-server","ref":"nick/308/onepipeline-ui-link-shared-app-server","sha":"a8dca64ea93de54002d1a0a2a289f16fda402a23","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.