/api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/395/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/a8dca64ea93de54002d1a0a2a289f16fda402a23"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/401","id":4939667397,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx3Fc88AAAABJm1XxQ","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/401","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/401.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/401.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/401","number":401,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(deps): link the engine release that installs on Linux arm64","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nLink onepipeline 0.80.1 and align shared dependencies with the engine. Update the browser’s reply grammar for interrupting notes, turn-end delivery, delivery timeouts and note withdrawal, and categorize the engine’s new timeline events.\n\n## Why\n\nLinux arm64 hosts cannot install the 0.79.x engine. Moving to 0.80.1 lets the next onepipeline-ui release pair with an installable engine at the same version, bringing the accumulated fixes to those hosts.\n\n## Additional info\n\nThis is a breaking library dependency update: public API items carry engine types. Manager notes delivered as `live` now interrupt live turns; `turn-end` delivery waits for the turn to end. Note withdrawal is supported through typed reply envelopes, without a composer shortcut.\n\nDispatch journeys now read prompts from the engine’s stdin frames, with argv fallback when control is unavailable, including when macOS temporary paths exceed the control socket’s path limit.","created_at":"2026-10-20T17:24:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-29T14:17:55Z","closed_at":"2026-10-29T14:17:55Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/401/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/401/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/401/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/eea2a0c67d9e2cbce75febc1fbdcc22f4e8c3a8f","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/public/3f5fae98409e/task-21","ref":"nick/public/3f5fae98409e/task-21","sha":"eea2a0c67d9e2cbce75febc1fbdcc22f4e8c3a8f","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url"