peline-ui/pulls/540","id":5064855684,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx3Fc88AAAABLeOQhA","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/540","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/540.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/540.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/540","number":540,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(deps)!: link the engine whose plan store routes by organization and classification","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nLink onepipeline 0.95.5 and onetaskgraph 0.12.9, bringing organization and privacy routing into the Observatory’s reader with one resolved copy of each dependency. Align release expectations and dependency history, update the markdown parser, and make the gzip streaming journey tolerate progress-only patches before the appended record.\n\n## Why\n\nThe host keeps the Observatory and its dispatching engine on the same release so runs are read by the engine that wrote them. This link lets the host adopt organization and privacy routing while keeping journal, launch-record and label parsing aligned.\n\n## Additional info\n\nThe release carries a breaking-change marker because the exact engine and store dependencies participate in this crate’s public types. No API route or payload changes are required beyond the engine version reported by `/healthz`.","created_at":"2026-10-29T08:34:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-29T11:49:36Z","closed_at":"2026-10-29T11:49:36Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/540/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/540/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/540/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/93a748cbaece9249ad5160b2ed1a1d3f0473634c","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/533/ui-link-org-classification-routes","ref":"nick/533/ui-link-org-classification-routes","sha":"93a748cbaece9249ad5160b2ed1a1d3f0473634c","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ni