tis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nAdopt onepipeline 0.95.5 and its onetaskgraph 0.12.9 store fix, with coverage that the read API serves engine-recorded runs containing a private Linear home and public task projections. Update `pulldown-cmark` to 0.13.5 to clear RUSTSEC-2026-0414.\n\n## Why\n\nThe host is moving its engine and read API installs from PyPI to npm. Aligning the reader with the fixed engine lets that adoption address [lost public task projections](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3781) alongside both npm launcher fixes, so the host can retire its launcher workaround and regression expected-failure marker together.","created_at":"2026-10-29T09:20:11Z","updated_at":"2026-10-29T11:04:27Z","closed_at":"2026-10-29T11:04:25Z","merged_at":"2026-10-29T11:04:25Z","merge_commit_sha":"08dc2dd40c789a09cebeb1f632204184cf0a1301","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/541/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/541/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/541/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/60830741894104ad97ab3c5d132e7f71551aec00","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/npm-engine-install/onepipeline-ui-adopt-fixed-engine","ref":"nick/npm-engine-install/onepipeline-ui-adopt-fixed-engine","sha":"60830741894104ad97ab3c5d132e7f71551aec00","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://git