rtis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"merge_method":"squash","commit_title":null,"commit_message":null},"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/531","id":5037033152,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx3Fc88AAAABLDsGwA","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/531","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/531.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/531.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/531","number":531,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"perf(deps)!: link the engine whose store batches private-source copies","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nRelink the read API to onepipeline 0.95.3 and align the onetaskgraph family and direct dev requirements to 0.12.7, resolving one engine and one plan-store release. Routes, response shapes and browser views remain unchanged; `/healthz` reports the adopted engine version.\n\nThe live telemetry journey now accepts either valid refresh outcome when a journal append races its receipt.\n\n## Why\n\nThe host’s DAG view must read run and plan-store records with the same engine and store releases the dispatching engine uses to write them. Keeping these dependencies aligned prevents a mismatch between the driver and its read API.\n\n## Additional info\n\nThis is announced as a breaking dependency move because the crate’s public API exposes engine types, including through `ApiError::from_engine`.","created_at":"2026-10-27T15:58:41Z","updated_at":"2026-10-27T16:52:43Z","closed_at":"2026-10-27T16:52:41Z","merged_at":"2026-10-27T16:52:40Z","merge_commit_sha":"689e235bb6af3956b521ea160b6c12cce2afc12e","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/531/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/531/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/