llowing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"merge_method":"squash","commit_title":null,"commit_message":null},"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/521","id":5026867886,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx3Fc88AAAABK5_qrg","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/521","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/521.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/521.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/521","number":521,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(deps)!: link the engine that holds a local-direct landing for its release, and show nodes held for one","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nRecognize `complete-but-held` and `complete-but-draft` throughout the read API and DAG view with onepipeline 0.95.0. Cards name the awaited release inside their borders, node details list every awaited producer and target, and the Host run list counts both statuses under their own words without treating them as failures or blockers. Add held/draft gallery views and refresh visual baselines.\n\n## Why\n\nThe browser must read runs with the engine that wrote them before the host can adopt release-held local-direct landing. Finished work awaiting a release should show what it awaits, rather than appearing unknown, broken or still running.\n\n## Additional info\n\nBreaking change: telemetry schema 27 expands the closed node-status vocabulary. Node results gain optional structured `awaiting` entries; clients switching on statuses must handle both new words. The branch retains the exact onepipeline 0.95.0 pin now also adopted on main.\n\nThe live-subscription journey prepares the removed run’s summary and checkpoint before serving it, then renames it out of the runs root before deletion to prevent read-triggered writes racing cleanup. It compares file bytes and entry modification times before and after removal from the root, reading metadata directly from each entry to avoid stale Windows directory-listing timestamps. The fixture-receipt journey also checks append behavior through the engine’s own reader.","created_at":"2026-10-27T00:48:58Z","updated_at":"2026-10-27T04:41:43Z","closed_at":"2026-10-27T04:41:40Z","merged_at":"2026-10-27T04:41:40Z","merge_commit_sha":"5117057b706110ac8ae9ee152fabc5960c090f5d","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/521/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/521/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/521/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/1a07a2af4e32164de0e47bd7b04d044c50e9a21b","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/507/ui-relink-consumes-published","ref":"nick/507/ui-relink-consumes-published","sha":"1a07a2af4e32164de0e47bd7b04d044c50e9a21b","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":1327351155,"node_id":"R_kgDOTx3Fcw","name":"onepipeline-ui","full_name":"nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui","private":false,"owner":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ND