,"merge_method":"squash","commit_title":null,"commit_message":null},"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/522","id":5027899167,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx3Fc88AAAABK6-nHw","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/522","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/522.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/522.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/522","number":522,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(deps)!: link the engine whose driver stays responsive however large its journal grows","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nRelink the read API and browser-adopted runs to onepipeline 0.95.0, bringing the driver’s journal-scaling improvements and member liveness stored outside the journal. Add API and browser journeys covering continued work during held turns, queued-note receipts and applied envelope outcomes, plus compatibility with older journalled heartbeats.\n\n## Why\n\nThe API and browser statically link their engine. Updating this dependency lets the host adopt the fixed driver for long-running runs and keep its reader and execution engine aligned.\n\n## Additional info\n\nBreaking change: the engine upgrade changes the engine types exposed by this crate’s public API. The Rust minimum version and sibling dependency resolutions remain unchanged.","created_at":"2026-10-27T03:00:09Z","updated_at":"2026-10-27T03:25:06Z","closed_at":"2026-10-27T03:25:04Z","merged_at":"2026-10-27T03:25:04Z","merge_commit_sha":"3aae22fd333daea06bbb87ae27e515f7e1da0a4a","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/522/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/522/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/522/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/f78c73dfd32b35adb662caec8d3d3fd66f4c5be4","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/382/opui-relink-driver-scaling","ref":"nick/382/opui-relink-driver-scaling","sha":"f78c73dfd32b35adb662caec8d3d3fd66f4c5be4","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/use