/onepipeline-ui/pulls/516","id":5012437641,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx3Fc88AAAABKsO6iQ","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/516","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/516.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/516.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/516","number":516,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(deps): link the engine whose plan store carries an id-only anchor into a public projection","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nLink the read API to published onepipeline `0.93.1`, bringing in onetaskgraph `0.12.5` and its fix for public projections carrying anchors without destinations. Align the store dependencies and packaging checks with that engine; `/healthz` now reports `0.93.1`.\n\n## Why\n\nMixed public/private plans whose public tasks own schema-2 budgets must be copyable onto the board before the host can adopt the engine needed for [reducing Codex launch network and quota consumption](https://github.com/nickderobertis/oneharness/issues/1442). ai-orchestrator requires its engine and this read API to link the same engine, so this dependency move enables that adoption.\n\n## Additional info\n\nThe published registry pin replaces the temporary engine git pin.","created_at":"2026-10-26T05:16:49Z","updated_at":"2026-10-26T15:41:39Z","closed_at":"2026-10-26T15:41:37Z","merged_at":"2026-10-26T15:41:37Z","merge_commit_sha":"5d6ad8f94e5dc9f7b7033b3a65f04c1477ac64ef","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/516/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/516/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/516/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/c3da8f015509409fc813e600ea412028addeaa1e","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/Share-one-Codex-app-server-across-dispatches-and-budget-network-data-per-launch/onepipeline-ui-link-store-anchor-fix","ref":"nick/Share-one-Codex-app-server-across-dispatches-and-budget-network-data-per-launch/onepipeline-ui-link-store-anchor-fix","sha":"c3da8f015509409fc813e600ea412028addeaa1e","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"