:{"enabled_by":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"merge_method":"squash","commit_title":null,"commit_message":null},"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/511","id":5009370929,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx3Fc88AAAABKpTvMQ","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/511","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/511.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/511.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/511","number":511,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(deps)!: link the engine whose private-term check honours a host's public phrases","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nRelink the read API from onepipeline 0.91.1 to 0.92.0, whose linked onevcs honours the host’s public phrases. `/healthz` now reports `onepipeline_version: \"0.92.0\"`; no other page, route or response changes.\n\n## Why\n\nThe browser must read runs with the same engine that wrote them. This relink lets the host adopt the engine that honours its phrase list, unblocking follow-up board writes currently refused by the publication boundary.\n\n## Additional info\n\nThis is a breaking dependency update because the crate’s public surface carries engine types, including `ApiError::from_engine`.\n\nOnly two Cargo.lock entries change:\n\n- `onepipeline` 0.91.1 → 0.92.0: adopts the engine release with public-phrase support.\n- `onevcs` 0.56.11 → 0.57.0: satisfies that engine’s linked dependency; the test-only exact requirement follows it.\n\nNo other lockfile entry changes. In particular, `serde-saphyr` retains its base64 0.23.1 dependency from the base branch.","created_at":"2026-10-25T22:30:48Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T22:53:18Z","closed_at":"2026-10-25T22:53:16Z","merged_at":"2026-10-25T22:53:16Z","merge_commit_sha":"4af60c19cb8e2a6085c4c7af10361fb7977b899a","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone"