kwDOTx3Fc88AAAABKkDrWw","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/489","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/489.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/489.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/489","number":489,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat!: link the screened export coordination engine","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nLink onepipeline 0.91.0 and onetaskgraph 0.12.1 so public tasks in private coordination runs retain screened exports through adoption and supervision. Update dependency fixtures and add journeys covering export isolation and refused unsafe edits, preserving existing API routes and browser presentation.\n\nMake Host gallery captures repeatable with fixed synthetic host diagnostics and update their visual baselines.\n\n## Why\n\nBrowser adoption uses the service’s statically linked engine. Matching it to command-line execution prevents recovered runs from losing screened export behavior.\n\n## Additional info\n\nThis is a breaking dependency upgrade: public filter helpers and `ApiError` conversions expose the engine’s types. Task visibility and publication protections remain owned by the engine; the service remains a private operator’s view.","created_at":"2026-10-25T10:21:43Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T12:34:26Z","closed_at":"2026-10-25T12:34:25Z","merged_at":"2026-10-25T12:34:25Z","merge_commit_sha":"1d53f1e364b3cdcc9b2e3c6b0378ab622b4b1d60","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/489/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/489/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/489/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/ff4fac470e9500e4dc4f3356c41579557da683b1","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/430/ui","ref":"nick/430/ui","sha":"ff4fac470e9500e4dc4f3356c41579557da683b1","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","