: 0.50.0 -> 0.51.0 (✓ API compatible changes)\n\n<details><summary><i><b>Changelog</b></i></summary><p>\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.51.0](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/compare/v0.50.0...v0.51.0) - 2026-10-24\n\n### Added\n\n- *(deps)* [**breaking**] show every conversation whole from its transcript, open it at any tool call, and time the timeline ([#457](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/457))\n\n### Fixed\n\n- *(deps)* link the engine whose stop ends every turn a dispatch started ([#458](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/458))\n</blockquote>\n\n\n</p></details>\n\n---\nThis PR was generated with [release-plz](https://github.com/release-plz/release-plz/).","created_at":"2026-10-24T18:38:31Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T22:17:21Z","closed_at":"2026-10-24T22:17:19Z","merged_at":"2026-10-24T22:17:19Z","merge_commit_sha":"63f298aef97e741a72491e292ca7f98424e112b9","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/460/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/460/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/460/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/2dc6941a41d6ff2feb5a82d2680269157030be27","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:release-plz-2026-10-24T18-38-28Z","ref":"release-plz-2026-10-24T18-38-28Z","sha":"2dc6941a41d6ff2feb5a82d2680269157030be27","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api