true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":0,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":73,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":0,"open_issues":73,"watchers":1,"default_branch":"main"}},"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/458"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/458"},"issue":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/458"},"comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/458/comments"},"review_comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/458/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/458/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/f1d933222de1a7450778944cf9143fa7007c3baf"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/457","id":4997177672,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx3Fc88AAAABKdrhSA","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/457","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/457.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/457.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/457","number":457,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(deps)!: show every conversation whole from its transcript, open it at any tool call, and time the timeline","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nServe whole, structured conversations from durable transcripts, including live turns, dead members and standalone harness sessions. Tool rows show one-line descriptions and open the conversation focused on the selected call. Run and node timelines gain readable time ticks and hover crosshairs; Remote checks show completed durations and advancing running times, leaving queued runtimes empty.\n\n## Why\n\nReaders need what the agent actually saw and did. Cut prompts misrepresent its instructions, and anonymous tool rows make runs hard to follow. Whole conversations, focused navigation and visible timing let readers trace a run to the moment that matters.\n\n## Additional info\n\nUses the transcript resolver in onepipeline 0.89.0 and the conversation and timeline components in `@oneharness/ui` 0.14.0. The breaking conversation surface changes advance telemetry schema to 26 and timeline schema to 14.\n\nLegacy runs recover whole text from stored reports or history where available; otherwise, bounded journal copies carry a visible recorder-cut notice. Unresolvable transcript references name the file and reason instead of appearing empty. Transcript and report artifacts are served whole; other logs retain their marked 64 KiB tail.\n\nShortens recorded-history fixture paths and adds a tracked-path guard for Windows CI and nested semver-check checkouts, addressing the checkout failures in [CI run 40113743603](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/actions/runs/40113743603). The install smoke also uses a separate build directory on Windows and macOS to prevent concurrent test builds from replacing an executable in use, addressing the Windows access-denied failure in [CI run 40115634774](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/actions/runs/40115634774).\n\nThe continued-rework comparison now normalizes relative ages between successive reads, addressing the minute-boundary failure in [CI run 40117111444](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/actions/runs/40117111444/job/120940839229). Focused regression cases preserve ordinary prose and Unicode text.","created_at":"2026-10-24T16:37:48Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T18:35:16Z","closed_at":"2026-10-24T18:35:13Z","merged_at":"2026-10-24T18:35:13Z","merge_commit_sha":"a35d87ae55e78c61032d4ad3d0afaad0e436956a","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/457/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/457/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/457/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/stat