ew_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/456/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/098c0638365d2b278f0224d61899fd9d54aa728c"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":{"enabled_by":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"merge_method":"squash","commit_title":null,"commit_message":null},"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/455","id":4995959548,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx3Fc88AAAABKchK_A","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/455","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/455.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/455.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/455","number":455,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(deps)!: follow onepipeline 0.89.0's types in the read API's public surface","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"BREAKING CHANGE: This crate’s public surface follows onepipeline 0.89.0’s; `ApiError::from_engine` takes `onepipeline::Error` from that release.\n\n## What\n\nClarify the packaged API documentation that this crate’s public surface follows the linked engine release and consumers must recompile when its type changes. Announce the break so the release workflow can version the engine relink appropriately. Dependencies, tests, and release machinery are unchanged.\n\n## Why\n\nThe plan-store fix that stops re-copying a plan from reopening finished issues must reach users through a release, fulfilling the request to deliver accepted follow-up fixes on the latest releases. The relink in #453 cannot ship until its public API break is announced.\n\n## Additional info\n\nAddresses the [release refusal](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/actions/runs/40098290757/job/120885036591). Head `88e38a6` carries the breaking subject and footer.\n\nRecorded verification on that head:\n\n- `cargo nextest run --locked --profile e2e -E 'test(/^server::/)'`: 232 passed, exit 0, 52.925s. Log: `/tmp/opui-server-e2e.log`.\n- `just semver-check /tmp/opui-v049-baseline v0.49.0`: passed, 196 checks passed and 58 skipped.\n- `just lint-llm-diff 142d486`: passed via Nx cache, 1 rule passed and 0 failed.\n\nThe verification report records [PR #455’s required checks](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/455) as green after reruns. Earlier live-inclusive local runs were not passes. The `live::` journeys exercise no line this documentation change touches and are outside this change’s required `server::` verification bar; their observed results are retained below.\n\n- `live::the_fixture_writers_receipts_are_the_engines_field_for_field`: full-tier retry failed at `live.rs:1392` (expected `appended`, received `reread`, 40 records). Log: `/tmp/opui-e2e-retry.log`. Isolated retry passed (1/1): `/tmp/opui-e2e-affected.log`.\n- `live::a_stale_telemetry_fold_catches_up_once_the_run_goes_quiet_without_holding_back_the_change`: subsequent full-tier retry failed at `live.rs:1461`, reporting that the change waited on a fold (`telemetry_fold_ms: 5.363364`). Log: `/tmp/opui-e2e-retry2.log`. Isolated retry passed (1/1): `/tmp/opui-e2e-telemetry.log`. An earlier local run also failed at this assertion (`telemetry_fold_ms: 1.340527`).\n- `live::a_cursor_older_than_the_retained_frames_is_answered_stale`: interrupted while still running after each tier’s assertion failure, at 302.238s and 107.386s. Logs: `/tmp/opui-e2e-retry.log` and `/tmp/opui-e2e-retry2.log`. Those tiers ended with 44 passed plus one assertion failure and one interruption, and 43 passed plus one assertion failure and one interruption, respectively.\n- [Earlier Windows CI](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/actions/runs/40100037716/job/120890124451): the cursor-retention journey failed at `tests/support/http.rs:148`.\n- [Earlier macOS CI](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/actions/runs/40101383645/job/120894322173): the telemetry journey failed at `live.rs:1460` (expected `appended`, received `reread`).\n\nLocal log paths refer to files on the verification worker; the linked CI jobs retain their own logs.","created_at":"2026-10-24T13:52:45Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T14:45:27Z","closed_at":"2026-10-24T14:45:25Z","merged_at":"2026-10-24T14:45:25Z","merge_commit_sha":"f6fdb5a0272f6f0ca022577e49d160e1d539f965","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/455/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/455/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/455/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/88e38a6e1d6ad4a6e1f562096ec33b6f711b4339","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/Verify-then-resolve-every-accepted-non-crozier-follow-up-ticket/opui-announce-break","ref":"nick/Verify-then-resolve-every-accepted-non-crozier-follow-up-ticket/opui-announce-break","sha":"88e38a6e1d6ad4a6e1f562096ec33b6f711b4339","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred