":"2026-08-08T02:34:01Z","updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:35:35Z","pushed_at":"2026-11-01T04:31:26Z","git_url":"git://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui.git","ssh_url":"user@example.invalid:nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui","homepage":null,"size":314622,"stargazers_count":1,"watchers_count":1,"language":"Rust","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":0,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":73,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":0,"open_issues":73,"watchers":1,"default_branch":"main"}},"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/455"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/455"},"issue":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/455"},"comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/455/comments"},"review_comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/455/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/455/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/88e38a6e1d6ad4a6e1f562096ec33b6f711b4339"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/453","id":4995464826,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx3Fc88AAAABKcC-eg","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/453","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/453.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/453.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/453","number":453,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(deps): link the engine that links the status-preserving plan store","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nLink the read API to onepipeline 0.89.0 and its onetaskgraph 0.11.1 store family, preserving the existing read API behavior. Also make the live-load fixture writer tolerate brief Windows receipt-replacement sharing errors.\n\n## Why\n\nRe-copying a plan currently reopens finished issues on the plans board. The status-preserving copy fix is released, but ai-orchestrator needs matching engine, reader and store versions to adopt it. This relink enables that adoption and fulfills the request to deliver accepted follow-up fixes on the latest releases.\n\n## Additional info\n\nThis is a breaking Rust dependency relink. The lockfile changes only onepipeline, the six onetaskgraph crates, oneagentgraph, oneharness-core, onejudge and onevcs; their versions match the engine’s v0.89.0 lockfile. SDK fixtures and the reported health version follow the new engine.\n\nCommit `90a871c` addresses the [required Windows job failure](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/actions/runs/40094964060/job/120875172776), where the load fixture writer received EPERM replacing `events.append.json` while the server read it. Replacement now makes at most 20 attempts, 10 ms apart, only for Windows EPERM/EACCES/EBUSY errors; other errors and exhausted retries still fail. Assertions, test timeouts and workflows are unchanged.\n\nRecorded validation on the finished local tree at `90a871c` (Linux):\n\n- Live run-view journeys and removed browser-supervision route: 24 passed. The continuous-load journey and removed-route test also passed in a separate focused run after the repair.\n- Browser header selection: 6 passed, including no Adopt control at five viewport sizes.\n- Load-writer happy and invalid-workload journeys: 2 passed.\n- Contract tests: 66 passed. Engine/store/sibling packaging selection: 7 passed.\n- Frontend build, API binary build, dag-ui-e2e lint, TypeScript check and `git diff --check` passed.\n- `just lint-llm-diff d09125a` passed on the final diff: llmlint history `20261024T125958Z-4c7b2` (7 passed, 0 failed, 28 skipped, 17 not relevant, 0 errors). The earlier relink-only diff also passed from cache as `20261024T123508Z-def23`.\n\nThe Windows-specific retry has not been exercised on this Linux host and still requires Windows CI verification. The linked failed job ran the preceding commit, `37ce619`.","created_at":"2026-10-24T12:41:16Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T13:28:34Z","closed_at":"2026-10-24T13:28:32Z","merged_at":"2026-10-24T13:28:32Z","merge_commit_sha":"142d486ae5410fc04b3b40a27f39caf2c0e07505","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/453/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/453/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/453/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/90a871cde4675983f0c7dea9b4a69dde76b007b7","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/Verify-then-resolve-every-accepted-non-crozier-follow-up-ticket/opui-relink-store","ref":"nick/Verify-then-resolve-every-accepted-non-crozier-follow-up-ticket/opui-relink-store","sha":"90a871cde4675983f0c7dea9b4a69dde76b007b7","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":1327351155,"node_id":"