55,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\n\n\n## 🤖 New release\n\n* `onepipeline-ui`: 0.48.1 -> 0.49.0 (✓ API compatible changes)\n\n<details><summary><i><b>Changelog</b></i></summary><p>\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.49.0](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/compare/v0.48.1...v0.49.0) - 2026-10-24\n\n### Added\n\n- *(deps)* [**breaking**] link the engine that skips withdrawn tasks and carries live-added images ([#446](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/446))\n\n### Performance\n\n- keep the Observatory current from pushed changes instead of refetching ([#444](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/444))\n</blockquote>\n\n\n</p></details>\n\n---\nThis PR was generated with [release-plz](https://github.com/release-plz/release-plz/).","created_at":"2026-10-24T01:42:49Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T11:23:50Z","closed_at":"2026-10-24T11:23:48Z","merged_at":"2026-10-24T11:23:47Z","merge_commit_sha":"d09125a6a22afb7e5e5b375e1dbd2c6cac6d4089","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"