":"chore: release v0.48.0","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\n\n\n## 🤖 New release\n\n* `onepipeline-ui`: 0.47.0 -> 0.48.0 (✓ API compatible changes)\n\n<details><summary><i><b>Changelog</b></i></summary><p>\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.48.0](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/compare/v0.47.0...v0.48.0) - 2026-10-23\n\n### Performance\n\n- *(deps)* [**breaking**] link the engine whose plan store approves in fewer calls ([#441](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/441))\n</blockquote>\n\n\n</p></details>\n\n---\nThis PR was generated with [release-plz](https://github.com/release-plz/release-plz/).","created_at":"2026-10-23T11:16:42Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T11:41:47Z","closed_at":"2026-10-23T11:41:45Z","merged_at":"2026-10-23T11:41:45Z","merge_commit_sha":"299d59a9ecaaf0fb75bdad86c450f8527f5761a6","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-u