ts","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"merge_method":"squash","commit_title":null,"commit_message":null},"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/441","id":4981170529,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx3Fc88AAAABKOahYQ","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/441","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/441.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/441.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/441","number":441,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"perf(deps)!: link the engine whose plan store approves in fewer calls","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nRelink the read API to onepipeline 0.86.0 and onetaskgraph 0.11.0, keeping the engine and plan-store dependencies aligned. Adapt timeline construction and copy fixtures to the new SDK while preserving read-API behavior, apart from the reported engine version.\n\n## Why\n\nThis lets ai-orchestrator adopt the cheaper plan-copy and approval calls while keeping its plan-store CLI, engine and read API on one linked store release. That alignment currently blocks moving approval cost from about 16 points toward the approved bar of 5.\n\n## Additional info\n\nBreaking Rust API change: engine-typed public interfaces move to the new engine release, and `payload::timeline` now requires a mutable `RunView`.","created_at":"2026-10-23T10:11:00Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T11:15:29Z","closed_at":"2026-10-23T11:15:26Z","merged_at":"2026-10-23T11:15:26Z","merge_commit_sha":"c9df511416e2fac74602221fda2a2a6fa83d4a8b","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/441/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/441/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/441/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/c8761a50fc8412327c7e23dd93a783c533426c31","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/Copy-a-plan-onto-the-board-and-approve-it-there-in-a-fraction-of-today-s-time/opui-relink-approval","ref":"nick/Copy-a-plan-onto-the-board-and-approve-it-there-in-a-fraction-of-today-s-time/opui-relink-approval","sha":"c8761a50fc8412327c7e23dd93a783c533426c31","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderober