_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"merge_method":"squash","commit_title":null,"commit_message":null},"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/439","id":4979240921,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx3Fc88AAAABKMkv2Q","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/439","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/439.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/439.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/439","number":439,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(test): show the node transcript before checking how runs collapse, however slowly the API answers","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nMake the run-collapse journey wait for complete node data within its existing test budget before checking that both record kinds collapse, expand and re-collapse at identical counts. Retain a delayed real API read as regression coverage, and add a journey proving Refresh restores the transcript after a connection reset.\n\n## Why\n\nThe page heading can appear before transcript data arrives, exhausting the old 15-second row assertion on a loaded runner. This flake blocked release PR #435 and the read API fix needed by [oneharness#1442](https://github.com/nickderobertis/oneharness/issues/1442), which addresses repeated catalog downloads costing affected hosts 30–50 GB daily. Fixing the timing dependency preserves the required check’s ability to catch missing rows and inconsistent collapse behavior.","created_at":"2026-10-23T07:14:03Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T07:33:09Z","closed_at":"2026-10-23T07:33:07Z","merged_at":"2026-10-23T07:33:07Z","merge_commit_sha":"06037fad26e5c36eaf78f1b4034e6d6868bb13b3","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/439/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/439/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/439/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/16847d6df9e0073755babcae3101fc89c3e94634","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/Share-one-Codex-app-server-across-dispatches-and-budget-network-data-per-launch/onepipeline-ui-run-collapse-transcript-flake","ref":"nick/Share-one-Codex-app-server-across-dispatches-and-budget-network-data-per-launch/onepipeline-ui-run-collapse-transcript-flake","sha":"16847d6df9e0073755babcae3101fc89c3e94634","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":1327351155,"node_id":"R_kgDOTx3Fcw","name":"onepipeline-ui","full_name":"nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui","private":false,"owner":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/follow