/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nRestore `agent_role` on observer sessions whose stream opens with a memberless `graph-started` record. Monitor and check-in spans retain their declared roles across multiple streams; undeclared members remain roleless, and existing persona fallback behavior is preserved.\n\n## Why\n\nAdopting the newest onepipeline-ui release on ai-orchestrator’s host exposed missing monitor and check-in lane labels. Restoring those labels unblocks adoption for the shared Codex app-server work in oneharness#1442.","created_at":"2026-10-22T21:48:02Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T05:11:23Z","closed_at":"2026-10-23T05:11:21Z","merged_at":"2026-10-23T05:11:21Z","merge_commit_sha":"564a71fa83c27c59eb02246b574b5ebdb8580bbc","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/436/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/436/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/436/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/one