":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/436"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/436"},"issue":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/436"},"comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/436/comments"},"review_comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/436/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/436/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/0b0c676c692e077068ec39af659dd4c2cbdce007"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/432","id":4970138689,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx3Fc88AAAABKD5MQQ","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/432","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/432.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/432.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/432","number":432,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(deps)!: one project-centric navigation with run kinds and a Host page","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nReplace the Projects/Runs split with one project sidebar, ordered by recent activity, with URL-backed kind filters and project selection opening the newest visible run. Move session attribution into run details and host resources, explicitly refreshed unwatched counts and owner-confirmed shutdown onto a dedicated Host page.\n\nRemove Reads and its obsolete client methods, preserving its information as structured fields in the remaining views. Align node statuses with the engine while retaining differing recorded outcomes, and update the real-server journeys and visual gallery.\n\n## Why\n\nPeople supervising runs think in pieces of work: planning, spikes, design, execution and follow-ups belong together. One project list makes those runs easier to find, while a separate Host page makes the scope of host-wide controls clear.\n\n## Additional info\n\nBreaking API change: telemetry schema 23 becomes 24, exposing effective labels, resolved groups, launch timestamps, structured host readings and run telemetry. Grouping includes copy origins and label overlays on older runs. Node statuses follow the engine and gain `ready`; differing recorded statuses remain available as outcomes. The contract and Zod schemas move together, and existing read API endpoints remain available. The finished tree links onepipeline 0.84.1, including pooled server cleanup.","created_at":"2026-10-22T15:46:48Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T20:32:33Z","closed_at":"2026-10-22T20:32:31Z","merged_at":"2026-10-22T20:32:31Z","merge_comm