},"merge_method":"squash","commit_title":null,"commit_message":null},"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/434","id":4972547300,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx3Fc88AAAABKGMM5A","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/434","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/434.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/434.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/434","number":434,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix: make the shutdown dialog test and recorded-run screenshots deterministic","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nStabilize the timeline reading cursor when an event detail is open, making recorded gate-run and session-closed captures reproducible. Update the seven affected baseline hashes and add a browser regression journey. Shutdown tests now complete through DOM events and promise settlement, with frozen timers and no polling waits.\n\n## Why\n\nFlaky checks blocked the version-only v0.46.0 release PR (#433), delaying the pooled-server cleanup needed for one shared Codex app-server across dispatches (nickderobertis/oneharness#1442). Fixing the timing dependencies removes the need to rerun checks until they pass.\n\n## Additional info\n\n- The visual race came from a scroll effect depending on a fresh hook object each render. Cursor updates retriggered scrolling to the selected event. Stress captures reproduced a 96-pixel cursor difference; the regression test failed with the old dependency, leaving the cursor at 93.8276% after scrolling back. Depending on the stable callback fixes it.\n- The shutdown test used real `userEvent` timer yields and role-query polling; it took 5.172 seconds in the [failing CI run](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/actions/runs/39824745503). The old test failed with frozen timers; the revised tests pass without advancing them, retaining the host-only and cancel-without-sending assertions.\n- Validation passed: 175 unit tests, 14 recorded browser journeys, 40 stress captures, formatter, lint, type checks and judged lint. Two consecutive full captures produced 105 byte-identical shots under `screencomp verify`, all matching the committed baseline.","created_at":"2026-10-22T18:55:13Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T19:19:28Z","closed_at":"2026-10-22T19:19:25Z","merged_at":"2026-10-22T19:19:25Z","merge_commit_sha":"8c271297dbba6773ab974abb484875aede2ce22f","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/434/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/434/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/434/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/5958ec1145c8971ed706dcd55b65eac9654d38ea","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/Share-one-Codex-app-server-across-dispatches-and-budget-network-data-per-launch/onepipeline-ui-release-ci-flakes","ref":"nick/Share-one-Codex-app-server-across-dispatches-and-budget-network-data-per-launch/onepipeline-ui-release-ci-flakes","sha":"5958ec1145c8971ed706dcd55b65eac9654d38ea","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":1327351155,"node_id":"R_kgDOTx3Fcw","name":"onepipeline-ui","full_name":"nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui","private":false,"owner":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github