,"compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/deployments","created_at":"2026-08-08T02:34:01Z","updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:35:35Z","pushed_at":"2026-11-01T04:31:26Z","git_url":"git://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui.git","ssh_url":"user@example.invalid:nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui","homepage":null,"size":314622,"stargazers_count":1,"watchers_count":1,"language":"Rust","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":0,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":73,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":0,"open_issues":73,"watchers":1,"default_branch":"main"}},"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/434"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/434"},"issue":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/434"},"comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/434/comments"},"review_comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/434/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/434/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/5958ec1145c8971ed706dcd55b65eac9654d38ea"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/431","id":4969973280,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx3Fc88AAAABKDvGIA","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/431","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/431.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/431.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/431","number":431,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat!: link onepipeline with pooled server cleanup","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nLink onepipeline 0.84.1 with oneharness-core 0.28.8, carrying the shared Codex app-server cleanup fix. Prevent delayed run-list responses from restoring streamed removals, make zoom-reset coverage tolerate the advancing live clock, and refresh the screenshots and visual baseline.\n\nAlign note-delivery coverage with immediate queued acknowledgments and add Linux shutdown coverage requiring every traced server task to exit within ten seconds after shutdown.\n\n## Why\n\nSharing one Codex app-server across dispatches requires reliable cleanup. ai-orchestrator keeps its engine and this read API on the same engine release, so this update lets the host adopt the fix from [oneharness#1520](https://github.com/nickderobertis/oneharness/pull/1520).\n\n## Additional info\n\nThis is a breaking Rust API dependency update: public items carrying engine types now use onepipeline 0.84.1. Browser adopt, watch and shutdown routes remain removed by contract. The new lifecycle coverage exercises read-server shutdown after SIGTERM or SIGINT; pooled app-server cleanup is covered by the engine’s own journeys.","created_at":"2026-10-22T15:34:44Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T17:36:09Z","closed_at":"2026-10-22T17:36:05Z","merged_at":"2026-10-22T17:36:05Z","merge_commit_sha":"59b61bbe3e6749283f8e4885aefeaa18554022b9","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/rep