is/onepipeline-ui/pulls/428","id":4962115095,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx3Fc88AAAABJ8PeFw","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/428","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/428.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/428.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/428","number":428,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat: one Remote tab with a per-check table, and a paired one-line channel","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nCombine PR and Checks into one Remote tab, with change-request, branch, merge and release details above linked checks showing status, conclusion and requiredness. Existing PR and Checks bookmarks open Remote.\n\nPair channel questions with their correlated replies and mark unanswered questions as waiting. Messages collapse to one-line previews, expand to complete text, and expose reply JSON through a further expansion.\n\n## Why\n\nA change request and its checks answer the same question: whether the work is progressing through its merge path. Keeping questions beside their answers makes the channel readable as a conversation, while compact previews let more exchanges fit on screen.\n\n## Additional info\n\nTelemetry schema 23 adds separate check conclusions, URLs and producer timestamps while retaining the existing combined `state`. Check runtime remains omitted.","created_at":"2026-10-22T04:29:28Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T05:34:44Z","closed_at":"2026-10-22T05:34:41Z","merged_at":"2026-10-22T05:34:41Z","merge_commit_sha":"0276cd7823b7f342256aaaff1073e832d91b4034","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/428/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/428/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/428/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/6f830beaa8737fb74a47e8d29232c3347140ff51","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/415/ui-remote-and-channel","ref":"nick/415/ui-remote-and-channel","sha":"6f830beaa8737fb74a47e8d29232c3347140ff51","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscr