:"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nMake run and node timelines order records by timestamp, count repeated records once, and keep worker dispatches and unnumbered drafters in their own groups. Session bars use consistent bounds across views; execution ends at settlement or shutdown, with later records shown as markers that add no work or idle.\n\nReplace run and node Agents tabs with timeline lanes and transcript links. Detail panels show record-specific facts without empty fields or misleading “Still running” labels. Record links use stable producer identities while preserving legacy bookmarks.\n\n## Why\n\nPeople use the timeline to reconstruct what an agent did and when. Misplaced records, misleading session bars and hours of idle attributed after completion lead to the wrong conclusions about a run.\n\n## Additional info\n\nTimeline schema advances to 13, adding record identity, grouping, detail and harness metadata while correcting ordering and execution bounds. Baseline comparisons account for those schema corrections while retaining checks on unchanged fields.\n\nIncludes recorded-run server and browser regression coverage for retries, repeated identities, session bounds, termination, detail panels and transcript navigation. Gallery coverage adds separate worker/drafter groups, record panels and a completion marker 41 hours after settlement; committed screenshots and the x86_64 digest baseline are refreshed.","created_at":"2026-10-21T23:15:49Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T01:46:41Z","closed_at":"2026-10-22T01:46:39Z","merged_at":"2026-10-22T01:46:39Z","merge_commit_sha":"b9cf79907064e08d79fc63fc0e117cbe8ef774db","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/426/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/n