AAAABJ38Lxw","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/425","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/425.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/425.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/425","number":425,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat!: remove watch, adopt and owner-scoped shutdown from the Observatory and its read API","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nRemove Watch, Adopt, per-run shutdown and “Shut down all my runs” from the browser and API, along with the unwatched badge and hidden driver commands. Keep Stop with its owner-refusal force confirmation, host shutdown in its existing location, and the unwatched API for Host use.\n\nKeep the run header on one line without overlapping navigation. Hide Stop on settled, failed and stopped runs; truncate last activity with an ellipsis, expose its full text in the title, and link it to its exact timeline event. Update documentation, gallery captures and real-server journeys.\n\n## Why\n\nWatching and adopting are manager actions: a browser user cannot tell how they will affect another manager already watching or driving the run. Removing them and owner-scoped shutdowns makes the remaining controls clearer. A compact header keeps the run’s identity, liveness and latest activity readable.\n\n## Additional info\n\nBreaking API change: `GET /api/v2/runs/{run}/watch`, `POST /api/v2/runs/{run}/adopt` and `POST /api/v2/runs/{run}/shutdown` now return `404 removed_route`, naming API 2 schema 22 as their removal version. `POST /api/v2/shutdown` accepts only host scope; other supplied scopes return `400 removed_shutdown_scope` naming the rejected scope. Its body is `{scope: \"host\", grace?: seconds, force?: false}`.\n\nTelemetry schema advances from 21 to 22, adding the exact timeline `event_id` to live activity. Opening a run also receives its existing activity immediately. API version 2 and the remaining `/api/v2` paths stay unchanged under the explicit removed-route exception in `docs/contract.md`: these supervision routes were used only by the bundled browser, which ships with their removal, so moving every path would disrupt unrelated clients.","created_at":"2026-10-21T20:02:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T00:49:53Z","closed_at":"2026-10-22T00:49:51Z","merged_at":"2026-10-22T00:49:51Z","merge_commit_sha":"d4d7db7f7575a24a6c2b760ba3d78641efb5d37b","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/425/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/425/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/425/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.gi