25"},"issue":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/425"},"comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/425/comments"},"review_comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/425/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/425/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/39b590d86707feb004a920588437cb6b37984394"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/424","id":4955822879,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx3Fc88AAAABJ2PbHw","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/424","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/424.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/424.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/424","number":424,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"ci(nx): stop the judged diff lint and root documents from selecting the crate and the view","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nIsolate the judged diff lint in `onepipeline-ui-judged-diff`, preserving its full-workspace content, base commit and judge fingerprint cache key. Give `docs/` its own project so unrelated documentation changes run their drift checks without selecting the crate, view or browser journeys.\n\nPackaged documents—including `README.md` and `docs/contract.md`—still select all three product projects. Existing `just lint-llm-diff` invocation forms remain supported.\n\n## Why\n\nUnrelated document edits were selecting Rust, frontend and browser checks on every change, wasting gate time and defeating the affected-only workflow.\n\n## Additional info\n\nCloses #264.\n\nRelated work: #257 remains separate and untouched; it addresses committed-head identity in the judged diff lint’s cache key.","created_at":"2026-10-21T17:40:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T18:03:05Z","closed_at":"2026-10-21T18:03:03Z","merged_at":"2026-10-21T18:03:02Z","merge_commit_sha":"b0abbfb37473d4ff19dc706d47f3ad8429490d3a","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/424/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/424/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/424/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/0553d485b334fc9a1ac958c442bfa9049d826ba5","head":{"label":"nickdero