vatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nRelink the read API to onepipeline 0.81.0 and align its plan-store dependencies with onetaskgraph 0.9.2, carrying faster board copies without changing read-API routes or envelopes. This is a breaking dependency update because public API items expose engine types.\n\n## Why\n\nThe host must align its plan-store CLI, engine and read API before faster copying reaches managers and users. This lets ai-orchestrator move its read-API pin onto the same engine release, replacing copies that take about 15 minutes and consume the shared board token.","created_at":"2026-10-21T08:46:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:06:03Z","closed_at":"2026-10-21T09:06:02Z","merged_at":"2026-10-21T09:06:02Z","merge_commit_sha":"fd4d3aac5611058b2dcc926af0d6f91166e86b3a","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/411/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/411/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepi