starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"merge_method":"squash","commit_title":null,"commit_message":null},"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/405","id":4943156227,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx3Fc88AAAABJqKUAw","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/405","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/405.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/405.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/405","number":405,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(deps)!: link the engine whose manager notes interrupt live turns","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nRelink to onepipeline 0.80.2 and its updated libraries, bringing per-receiver note holds, turn-end delivery with optional timeouts, and live-note withdrawal to browser-adopted runs. Reply envelopes retain the engine’s own receipts and refusals.\n\nTimeline schema 12 adds `redirection.turn`, and the browser shows whether a note interrupted a turn or reached it at turn end. Older records without `turn` remain readable.\n\n## Why\n\nThe browser drives adopted runs with its statically linked engine. Matching the CLI’s release gives browser managers the same delivery and withdrawal behavior and lets the host’s engine-version gate accept adoption.\n\n## Additional info\n\nThis is a breaking dependency update because the crate’s public API exposes engine types. Timeline schema 12 is additive over 11; the contract documents the optional field.","created_at":"2026-10-20T22:06:54Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T22:31:54Z","closed_at":"2026-10-20T22:31:53Z","merged_at":"2026-10-20T22:31:52Z","merge_commit_sha":"741dad9a0eb3d01ac58fafcabc01a17a1f4d2e94","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/405/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/405/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/405/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/b944db022bed82f7461e7792520e36bcf1db61d7","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/366/ui-relink-notes","ref":"nick/366/ui-relink-notes","sha