comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/405/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/405/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/b944db022bed82f7461e7792520e36bcf1db61d7"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/403","id":4941980339,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx3Fc88AAAABJpCisw","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/403","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/403.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/403.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/403","number":403,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(release): finish a re-run whose earlier attempt already published","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nRelease reruns preserve artifacts already held by PyPI or npm, even when a rebuild differs, and wait up to five minutes for npm to serve a previously accepted version. GitHub archives and checksums are kept or replaced together; verification runs the published builds and reports differences between registries.\n\n## Why\n\nv0.41.2’s release run 39426287439 could not be completed by rerunning `build-windows`: npm first refused an upload over a held version, then the rerun rejected the earlier package because its rebuild differed. The launcher never shipped.","created_at":"2026-10-20T20:23:30Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T21:12:46Z","closed_at":"2026-10-20T21:12:44Z","merged_at":"2026-10-20T21:12:44Z","merge_commit_sha":"7c01ad808643f6e87210b0d8a52f7380e75ad808","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/403/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/403/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/403/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/f6941b123f0cdab5ff4182fdbad3cb963d135c66","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/release-rerun-registry-held","ref":"nick/release-rerun-registry-held","sha":"f6941b123f0cdab5ff4182fdbad3cb963d135c66","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderober