/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/400"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/400"},"issue":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/400"},"comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/400/comments"},"review_comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/400/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/400/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/6d0e3809bda0d06a9327a3c2a67a480a572fc14a"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/398","id":4937446921,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx3Fc88AAAABJkt2CQ","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/398","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/398.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/398.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/398","number":398,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(release): fail a platform npm upload the registry never received","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nFail npm uploads immediately when npm stages the package for approval, naming the package, version and stage id instead of reporting it published. The shared upload path covers every platform and the platform-independent packages, and also fails if the stage queue is unreadable or malformed.\n\n## Why\n\nFive consecutive releases failed to reach npm, blocking consumers that need the frontend bundle and PyPI wheel at the same version from adopting the fixes. Reporting staged publishes at the upload identifies the action needed to unblock release delivery.\n\n## Additional info\n\nThe v0.41.2 [first Windows upload](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/actions/runs/39426287439/job/118639572710) reported success; its [retry](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/actions/runs/39426287439/job/118658838077) received npm's `409 Conflict`: `Cannot publish over previously staged version \"0.41.2\"`. npm had accepted the upload into staging and exited zero, which the release script treated as publication. Successful subprocess output was captured, explaining the missing npm output in the first log.\n\nThe regression tests drive the real upload recipe and npm CLI against a registry stand-in reproducing that staging response. With the old upload script, three tests failed and one passed, including the same false Windows publication report. With the fix, all four pass, covering staging, retry before and after approval, successful publication, and unreadable or malformed stage queues. This reproduces the registry mechanism on Linux; it does not depend on executing a Windows binary.\n\nFinal-tree verification: all 44 tests in the release test target's command passed; `just fmt-check` and `just lint` passed; `just lint-llm-diff origin/main` replayed a cached verdict with 16 rules passed and zero failed. The full Nx target stopped at its rehearsal dependency on this aarch64 host: `tests/release/publication.test.mjs` refused the binary with `wheel binary does not have the declared Linux architecture`, and `tests/release/journeys.test.mjs` encountered `exec /usr/local/bin/manylinux-entrypoint: exec format error` in `quay.io/pypa/manylinux2014_x86_64`. Target architectures and the code enforcing these refusals are unchanged.\n\nNo upload, wait or check is skipped or made optional, and no timeout is increased; #391's registry waits remain intact. Staged versions still require a maintainer to run `npm stage approve <id>` before retrying. Unattended releases require a credential npm permits to publish directly.","created_at":"2026-10-20T14:40:45Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T15:06:13Z","closed_at":"2026-10-20T15:06:11Z","merged_at":"2026-10-20T15:06:11Z","merge_commit_sha":"fa7e930808d5bad13509f22e2d4d93c71acfdf80","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/398/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/398/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/398/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/b9f0aaa1796a14d5323ac451733e4791d3388d36","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/public/053915a63874/task-20","ref":"nick/public/053915a63874/task-20","sha":"b9f0aaa1796a14d5323ac451733e4791d3388d36","user"