/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/389/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/5ed66ab86c224d3e999f4ea219ba420de113969e"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/391","id":4932679196,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx3Fc88AAAABJgK2HA","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/391","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/391.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/391.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/391","number":391,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(release): wait for wheels and npm packages a registry has not listed yet","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nRelease checks now wait within one shared deadline for PyPI to list uploaded wheels and npm to serve platform packages. Frontend verification uses a retried install instead of failing on a single registry lookup. Failed builds, missing Release assets, and registry timeouts still block platform-independent publication.\n\n## Why\n\nv0.41.1’s check failed in six seconds because PyPI had not yet listed two wheels uploaded about 40 seconds earlier, skipping the wait for npm packages that appeared later. v0.41.0’s verification likewise rejected a frontend that npm listed 97 seconds after upload.","created_at":"2026-10-20T07:48:48Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T12:47:55Z","closed_at":"2026-10-20T12:47:53Z","merged_at":"2026-10-20T12:47:53Z","merge_commit_sha":"7421b2158718bc0bb04fb7179b7ffa59cdd17f62","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/391/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/391/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/391/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/1ccc5f173445af9fc8cb5abdab5f597cfe2a6db8","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/release-publish-check","ref":"nick/release-publish-check","sha":"1ccc5f173445af9fc8cb5abdab5f597cfe2a6db8","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderober