":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nPin the read API to onepipeline 0.79.1, bringing clearer publication-unavailability and workspace-slot diagnostics and refusal of uncertain copy destinations to browser-adopted runs. Update the lockfile and health-check expectation; sibling versions and MSRV remain unchanged.\n\n## Why\n\nThe host must pin the same engine as the read API, which statically links the engine driving browser-adopted runs. This release lets both move together so those runs receive the engine’s fixes.","created_at":"2026-10-20T05:31:51Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T05:49:40Z","closed_at":"2026-10-20T05:49:37Z","merged_at":"2026-10-20T05:49:37Z","merge_commit_sha":"8959ca9e7e0e072971385180a7d2445cd619daad","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/388/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls