"spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":0,"open_issues":73,"watchers":1,"default_branch":"main"}},"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/384"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/384"},"issue":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/384"},"comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/384/comments"},"review_comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/384/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/384/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/statuses/0212dd1e34940406d7a7c7ad4a626fa6100e1a23"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/378","id":4925496901,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx3Fc88AAAABJZUeRQ","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/378","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/378.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/378.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/378","number":378,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(release): publish every artifact from Windows and after a slow npm registry","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nAdd release publication journeys covering fresh and partially published versions, and include them in the release project’s Nx test target. Exercise Windows staged installation through a host stand-in, including the server shutdown used by the release scripts.\n\n## Why\n\nThe incomplete v0.40.0 release blocks ai-orchestrator’s engine upgrade: its host requires matching npm and wheel versions, but the npm launcher was never published. The next release must deliver every artifact and safely finish publication when some artifacts already exist.\n\n## Additional info\n\nThe production fixes are now on main through [#379](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pull/379); this diff adds regression coverage and connects it to the repository’s suite.\n\n- In [v0.40.0’s failed release](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/actions/runs/39263438487), Windows reported `onepipeline-api.cmd' is not on PATH after the install`. `verify-staged-release.mjs` passed the batch shim to Bash, whose `command -v` rejected it. The regression exercises that script with Windows launcher behavior; `npmLauncher` now supplies the shell shim to Bash and retains `.cmd` for Node.\n- Linux reported `npm onepipeline-api-cli-linux-x64 0.40.0: still not installable after 13 attempts over 559s`. The recorded diagnosis was delayed registry availability: metadata appeared after 5m14s, followed by another 300s of cached tarball 404s. The finished tree waits for platform packages in the publish job, with one shared 900-second deadline. Local registry tests cover eventual installation and permanent unavailability without accepting an uninstallable package.\n- Local PyPI, npm, crates.io and GitHub stand-ins exercise the real publication recipes from both empty registries and v0.40.0’s partial state, checking every wheel, npm platform package, launcher, frontend package, crate and release asset. Cross-platform publication uses staged fixtures; native installation runs on Linux.\n- The final `npx nx run onepipeline-ui-release:test` passed all 57 tests across `rehearse` and `test`, with none skipped. Only the frontend build was cached. Biome checks passed over the release tests, workflow tests and touched release scripts. The manylinux rehearsal passed without the earlier CentOS mirror error.\n\nThe separate pull-request CI timeout follow-ups remain outside this change.","created_at":"2026-10-19T18:26:22Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T20:38:50Z","closed_at":"2026-10-19T20:38:49Z","merged_at":"2026-10-19T20:38:49Z","merge_commit_sha":"a0d645d004067f69e62b4d6459127674be8e9ff1","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/378/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/378/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline-ui/issues/378/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipel